---
import WritingLayout from "../layouts/WritingLayout.astro";
---

<WritingLayout title="Writing | Bryce Mason">
  <section class="page">
    <section class="page-head">
      <p class="mini-label">Writing</p>
      <h1>Notes on venture capital, climate tech, finance, and related industries.</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        A space for short writing, observations, and ideas as I continue learning
        and building my perspective. Some sections are still taking shape.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="writing-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="mini-label">Sections</p>
        <h2>Current writing areas</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="writing-grid">
        <a class="writing-card" href="/writing/vc-notes">
          <p class="tag">Venture Capital</p>
          <h3>VC Notes</h3>
          <p>
            Thoughts on venture capital, startups, investing, and what I am
            learning about the industry.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="writing-card" href="/writing/climate-tech-notes">
          <p class="tag">Climate Tech</p>
          <h3>Climate Tech Notes</h3>
          <p>
            Notes on climate-related industries, business models, market trends,
            and questions I find interesting.
          </p>
        </a>

        <div class="writing-card static-card">
          <p class="tag">In Progress</p>
          <h3>More Writing Coming Soon</h3>
          <p>
            I plan to expand this section over time with additional short posts,
            reactions, and research-based notes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reading-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <p class="mini-label">Reading</p>
    <h2>What I’m reading</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="reading-card">
    <div class="reading-list">
      <div class="reading-item">
        <h3>The Business of Venture Capital</h3>
        <p class="author">by Mahendra Ramsinghani</p>
        <p>
          I am reading this to better understand how venture firms are
          structured, how funds work, and how investors think about the
          business of VC beyond just deals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reading-item">
        <h3>Too Big to Fail</h3>
        <p class="author">by Andrew Ross Sorkin</p>
        <p>
          I am interested in the decision-making, institutional pressures,
          and financial dynamics surrounding the 2008 financial crisis.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reading-item">
        <h3>Endurance: Shackleton’s Incredible Voyage</h3>
        <p class="author">by Alfred Lansing</p>
        <p>
          This is a very different kind of book, but I like it for its
          focus on leadership, resilience, and decision-making under
          pressure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reading-item">
        <h3>Galileo’s Error: Foundations for a New Science of Consciousness</h3>
        <p class="author">by Philip Goff</p>
        <p>
          This one is more philosophical, and I like that it pushes me into
          a different kind of thinking than the finance and business books.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
  </section>
</WritingLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .writing-section {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .reading-section {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .mini-label {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #a9c2af;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #f2f2f2;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #c8cfcc;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .writing-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .writing-card {
    display: block;
    background: #1c1f22;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e33;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 28px;
    transition: background 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
  }

  .writing-card:hover {
    background: #314138;
    border-color: #42564a;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .static-card:hover {
    background: #1c1f22;
    border-color: #2a2e33;
    transform: none;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #2c3a31;
    color: #a9c2af;
    border: 1px solid #3b4c40;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .writing-card p,
  .reading-card p {
    color: #c8cfcc;
  }

  .reading-card {
    background: #1c1f22;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e33;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .reading-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .reading-item + .reading-item {
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2e33;
  }

  .author {
    color: #a9c2af;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .reading-item p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .writing-card,
    .reading-card {
      padding: 22px 20px;
      border-radius: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>